{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "mike-study", "elements": [{"id": "cfd4758d1fef43cfb180", "type": "rectangle", "x": 34, "y": 254, "width": 2392, "height": 278.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 55, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 2119798758, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1329620321, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177548, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "d58a74fab0744069a5ea", "type": "text", "x": 50, "y": 264, "width": 280.5, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 490806628, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1204271513, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177548, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "TIGA LAPIS PERLINDUNGAN", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "TIGA LAPIS PERLINDUNGAN", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "d72a95ffb227438c91b6", "type": "rectangle", "x": 34, "y": 594, "width": 2392, "height": 245.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 55, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 491584738, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 604130836, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177548, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "c42644aeba7f49f38773", "type": "text", "x": 50, "y": 604, "width": 495.0, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 89856019, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 59503281, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177548, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "OPERASI YANG MENGAMBIL LEASE / MENGAMATI", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "OPERASI YANG MENGAMBIL LEASE / MENGAMATI", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "49ab8f8ec14b446da39c", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 130, "width": 2340, "height": 116.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["93f974da8b034a3ebef7"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 2000846601, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1184800104, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419177548, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e1ad4fa0a8534edd8a63", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 144, "width": 227.3, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["93f974da8b034a3ebef7"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 698801331, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2057385286, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177548, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Masalah yang dipecahkan", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Masalah yang dipecahkan", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "ee85159cc06243c19b32", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 175.8, "width": 615.8, "height": 56.2, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["93f974da8b034a3ebef7"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1351858062, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1493077387, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177548, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Banyak yang bisa menyentuh sel sekaligus: dua klik Run, dua tab, regenerate sel,\nclear-cells, worker yang lambat, server restart di tengah jalan.\nTanpa aturan, hasil lama bisa menimpa hasil baru, atau sel macet 'generating' selamanya.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Banyak yang bisa menyentuh sel sekaligus: dua klik Run, dua tab, regenerate sel,\nclear-cells, worker yang lambat, server restart di tengah jalan.\nTanpa aturan, hasil lama bisa menimpa hasil baru, atau sel macet 'generating' selamanya.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "ab4ab74e046b4330a806", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 300, "width": 720, "height": 206.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e67700", "backgroundColor": "#ffec99", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["314d50f09ce6422ebc76"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 24468265, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1329945547, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "0d0869af218d4336b2d5", "type": "arrow"}], "updated": 1793419177548, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "b3a98b03ff284a3198bf", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 322.1, "width": 292.6, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e67700", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["314d50f09ce6422ebc76"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2055738127, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 666179354, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177548, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1 · Lease di baris tabular_reviews", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "1 · Lease di baris tabular_reviews", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e33af02c30d04f97a442", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 353.9, "width": 457.8, "height": 130.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["314d50f09ce6422ebc76"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 145665462, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 896351296, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177548, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "active_generation_id + generation_lease_expires_at\nRPC begin_tabular_review_generation(review,\n   expected_updated_at, generation_id, lease_seconds=300)\n→ 'started' | 'running' (409 review_running)\n   | 'stale' (409 review_stale) | 'not_found'\nAtomik di DB: dua pemanggil tak bisa sama-sama menang.\nexpected_updated_at = versi review yang dilihat klien →\n   klien dengan tampilan basi ditolak.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "active_generation_id + generation_lease_expires_at\nRPC begin_tabular_review_generation(review,\n   expected_updated_at, generation_id, lease_seconds=300)\n→ 'started' | 'running' (409 review_running)\n   | 'stale' (409 review_stale) | 'not_found'\nAtomik di DB: dua pemanggil tak bisa sama-sama menang.\nexpected_updated_at = versi review yang dilihat klien →\n   klien dengan tampilan basi ditolak.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "79618c16e8e3442e8472", "type": "rectangle", "x": 870, "y": 300, "width": 720, "height": 206.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e67700", "backgroundColor": "#ffec99", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["15d4d3c3535c410d8832"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1688109034, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2141063306, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "0d0869af218d4336b2d5", "type": "arrow"}, {"id": "7eba66f44efb40129bd3", "type": "arrow"}], "updated": 1793419177548, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "f5f3edd5da4644e2a9c0", "type": "text", "x": 884, "y": 314, "width": 199.0, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e67700", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["15d4d3c3535c410d8832"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 864785018, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 396749833, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177548, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2 · Perpanjang & lepas", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "2 · Perpanjang & lepas", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "83b3bb98d78f44439b54", "type": "text", "x": 884, "y": 345.8, "width": 473.8, "height": 146.2, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["15d4d3c3535c410d8832"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 847556006, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1970365623, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177548, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "renew_tabular_review_generation tiap 60 dtk\n   (heartbeat; false = lease sudah milik orang lain\n   → pemegang lama BERHENTI menulis)\nfinish_tabular_review_generation: lepas (best-effort;\n   gagal = lease habis sendiri 300 dtk)\nSync: request/run memegang lease sepanjang hidupnya.\nAsync: request hanya MENGKLAIM lalu menyerahkan ke antrean;\n   worker merenew; worker terakhir melepas\n   (finishGenerationIfIdle: tak ada sel berstempel lagi).", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "renew_tabular_review_generation tiap 60 dtk\n   (heartbeat; false = lease sudah milik orang lain\n   → pemegang lama BERHENTI menulis)\nfinish_tabular_review_generation: lepas (best-effort;\n   gagal = lease habis sendiri 300 dtk)\nSync: request/run memegang lease sepanjang hidupnya.\nAsync: request hanya MENGKLAIM lalu menyerahkan ke antrean;\n   worker merenew; worker terakhir melepas\n   (finishGenerationIfIdle: tak ada sel berstempel lagi).", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "c258ac922175474d843c", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1680, "y": 300, "width": 720, "height": 206.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["a933304cb6e04ed6bea2"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 790276467, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1509937759, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "7eba66f44efb40129bd3", "type": "arrow"}], "updated": 1793419177548, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "39439145d03145e8ba78", "type": "text", "x": 1694, "y": 322.1, "width": 312.2, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["a933304cb6e04ed6bea2"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 614070320, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1652320425, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177548, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3 · Stempel generation_id di tiap sel", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "3 · Stempel generation_id di tiap sel", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "7e78ee3ced7a4981a4a5", "type": "text", "x": 1694, "y": 353.9, "width": 473.8, "height": 130.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["a933304cb6e04ed6bea2"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1540998661, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1193337271, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177548, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Sel yang akan dikerjakan diberi stempel generation_id\n  (claimCellsForGeneration) SEBELUM job dikirim.\nSemua tulis sel: .eq('generation_id', milik-saya)\n  — termasuk 'tandai generating' yang mengosongkan content.\nRun yang lease-nya diambil alih → UPDATE tidak cocok\n  baris mana pun → TIDAK bisa menimpa hasil pemenang.\nfinalizeCell = satu-satunya penulis status terminal\n  (pending/error) + hapus stempel.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Sel yang akan dikerjakan diberi stempel generation_id\n  (claimCellsForGeneration) SEBELUM job dikirim.\nSemua tulis sel: .eq('generation_id', milik-saya)\n  — termasuk 'tandai generating' yang mengosongkan content.\nRun yang lease-nya diambil alih → UPDATE tidak cocok\n  baris mana pun → TIDAK bisa menimpa hasil pemenang.\nfinalizeCell = satu-satunya penulis status terminal\n  (pending/error) + hapus stempel.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "5a91a4404907415fb7b4", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 640, "width": 760, "height": 173.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["2f3b28afde5d47e5b683"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 245156976, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 360866754, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419177548, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "9bdd6f1455aa4e49bc2a", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 654, "width": 406.4, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["2f3b28afde5d47e5b683"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 968345972, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 852940124, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177548, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Regenerate satu sel  POST /:id/regenerate-cell", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Regenerate satu sel  POST /:id/regenerate-cell", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "53e16f12105c49a9b838", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 685.8, "width": 473.8, "height": 113.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["2f3b28afde5d47e5b683"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 740740187, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 306383050, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177548, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "hak edit · klaim lease baru (mutationId) → 409 bila ada run\nmodel + kunci divalidasi · dokumen baris dicek aksesnya\nasync: enqueueExtraction{columnIndex} (jobId unik per sel,\n   tak dedupe dgn job baris penuh) → awaitCellTerminal\n   (poll DB tiap 1 dtk, batas 120 dtk) · heartbeat lease\nsync: queryTabularCell langsung · lepas lease di akhir\nbalasan: konten sel selesai (bukan stream)", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "hak edit · klaim lease baru (mutationId) → 409 bila ada run\nmodel + kunci divalidasi · dokumen baris dicek aksesnya\nasync: enqueueExtraction{columnIndex} (jobId unik per sel,\n   tak dedupe dgn job baris penuh) → awaitCellTerminal\n   (poll DB tiap 1 dtk, batas 120 dtk) · heartbeat lease\nsync: queryTabularCell langsung · lepas lease di akhir\nbalasan: konten sel selesai (bukan stream)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "be4dc771da1b40c2a0b7", "type": "rectangle", "x": 850, "y": 640, "width": 760, "height": 173.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#d9480f", "backgroundColor": "#ffd8a8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["04d09c4612f6410dbd4d"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 2029138135, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 399263579, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419177548, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "45a659968f9e4198a9f6", "type": "text", "x": 864, "y": 654, "width": 352.0, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#d9480f", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["04d09c4612f6410dbd4d"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1556254112, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1648275926, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177548, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Clear sel  POST /:id/clear-cells {row_ids}", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Clear sel  POST /:id/clear-cells {row_ids}", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "cc43b43bb0c640b6a6fe", "type": "text", "x": 864, "y": 685.8, "width": 481.8, "height": 113.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["04d09c4612f6410dbd4d"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1824852372, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 86704257, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177548, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "hak edit · tolak bila lease masih aktif (409)\nklaim lease sendiri selama operasi\nasync: removeQueuedExtractionJobs — job menunggu DIHAPUS;\n   job aktif diberi marker 'canceled' (percobaan berikut\n   keluar tanpa mengklaim ulang); best-effort, Redis mati OK\nkosongkan content, status 'pending', buang stempel\n   → tulis terminal job zombie jadi tak cocok (guard)", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "hak edit · tolak bila lease masih aktif (409)\nklaim lease sendiri selama operasi\nasync: removeQueuedExtractionJobs — job menunggu DIHAPUS;\n   job aktif diberi marker 'canceled' (percobaan berikut\n   keluar tanpa mengklaim ulang); best-effort, Redis mati OK\nkosongkan content, status 'pending', buang stempel\n   → tulis terminal job zombie jadi tak cocok (guard)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "370e4bb538f14ca688bf", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1640, "y": 640, "width": 760, "height": 173.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "#d0bfff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["ce2adb2aa01a4ea68b44"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 216154037, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 856311961, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419177548, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "3bbe2595b7bb4fc0bdce", "type": "text", "x": 1654, "y": 662.1, "width": 150.1, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["ce2adb2aa01a4ea68b44"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2088904403, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 374250516, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177548, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Stop & reconnect", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Stop & reconnect", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "33fe4fbaa71e40ff84c8", "type": "text", "x": 1654, "y": 693.9, "width": 522.0, "height": 97.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["ce2adb2aa01a4ea68b44"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1361718767, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1486105841, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177548, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "POST /:id/generate/stop — hanya mode sync (run milik server):\n   run.stop() → sel belum selesai kembali 'pending'\n   async: 404 generation_not_found (tak ada run untuk dihentikan)\nGET /:id/generate/stream — pengamat murni, TANPA lease:\n   menonton / mengejar run tanpa bisa memblokirnya\nStop butuh hak EDIT saja (bukan model/kunci milik peminta)", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "POST /:id/generate/stop — hanya mode sync (run milik server):\n   run.stop() → sel belum selesai kembali 'pending'\n   async: 404 generation_not_found (tak ada run untuk dihentikan)\nGET /:id/generate/stream — pengamat murni, TANPA lease:\n   menonton / mengejar run tanpa bisa memblokirnya\nStop butuh hak EDIT saja (bukan model/kunci milik peminta)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "db91dd8d2e3a45b6b140", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 1000, "width": 2340, "height": 157.2, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["ee819d30ce754bc7afea"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 405229701, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1625276999, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419177548, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "0dbc5fbc46354c9f9428", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 1014, "width": 619.9, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["ee819d30ce754bc7afea"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1678212484, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 821393438, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177548, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Pembersih sel yatim (jobs/maintenance → sweepStaleGeneratingCells)", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Pembersih sel yatim (jobs/maintenance → sweepStaleGeneratingCells)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "402325f9842c461c8333", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 1045.8, "width": 949.2, "height": 97.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["ee819d30ce754bc7afea"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 745992690, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1994628274, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177548, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Crash di jendela yang salah bisa menelantarkan sel 'generating': request mati di tengah, atau job hilang antara tulis-status dan enqueue.\nAturan aman: (1) hanya bila antrean ekstraksi aktif — 'generating tanpa job hidup' cukup sebagai bukti yatim;\n  (2) sel dilindungi lease review: lease belum habis = ada pemegang hidup, jangan sentuh; (3) job masih ada di antrean (Redis/db_jobs) = lewati;\n  (4) sel yatim dibalik lewat finalizeCell → 'error' (bukan spinner abadi), lalu finishGenerationIfIdle sekali per generasi yang disentuh.\nMode sinkron tanpa antrean: sel macet diperbaiki dengan klik ulang (tak ada sinyal usia untuk membedakan).\nDokumen 'processing' basi (updated_at > STALE_DOC_PROCESSING_MS, default 30 mnt) disapu pembersih yang sama; dilewati bila job konversi masih ada.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Crash di jendela yang salah bisa menelantarkan sel 'generating': request mati di tengah, atau job hilang antara tulis-status dan enqueue.\nAturan aman: (1) hanya bila antrean ekstraksi aktif — 'generating tanpa job hidup' cukup sebagai bukti yatim;\n  (2) sel dilindungi lease review: lease belum habis = ada pemegang hidup, jangan sentuh; (3) job masih ada di antrean (Redis/db_jobs) = lewati;\n  (4) sel yatim dibalik lewat finalizeCell → 'error' (bukan spinner abadi), lalu finishGenerationIfIdle sekali per generasi yang disentuh.\nMode sinkron tanpa antrean: sel macet diperbaiki dengan klik ulang (tak ada sinyal usia untuk membedakan).\nDokumen 'processing' basi (updated_at > STALE_DOC_PROCESSING_MS, default 30 mnt) disapu pembersih yang sama; dilewati bila job konversi masih ada.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "cac433b9c394430f9834", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 20, "width": 1320.9, "height": 40.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1583432822, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 905368726, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419177548, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Tabular review C — lease generasi, konkurensi, regenerate/clear, dan pembersih sel yatim", "fontSize": 32, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Tabular review C — lease generasi, konkurensi, regenerate/clear, dan pembersih sel yatim", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "7781ce7e01cc4e77a96f", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 66, "width": 962.8, "height": 20.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds":